    "description": "Spatial and media blocks for operational and monitoring dashboards: a live Leaflet map with markers and zone overlays, a zone-status summary grid, and an evidence media player for video/image clips. Built for real-time operational apps (incident response, facility monitoring, field operations) \u2014 every block updates live via the core live-block channel and falls back to polling. Distinct from the geolocation-primitive plugin (apppress/geo): these are opt-in, Leaflet-backed dashboard visuals.",
